=3D"2" data-index-in-node=3D"103">anything</i> in the app asks for the <cod=
e data-path-to-node=3D"2" data-index-in-node=3D"136">LocalDbContext</code>.=
</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"3">Here is the quick fix to shift that responsi=
bility to the correct place.</p><h3 data-path-to-node=3D"4">1. Update <code=
 data-path-to-node=3D"4" data-index-in-node=3D"10">LocalDbContext.cs</code>=
