.</p><p data-path-to-node=3D"2">Here is exactly how to bypass the PMC's bli=
nd spot and fix the build so the migration generates.</p><h3 data-path-to-n=
ode=3D"3">Step 1: Unhide the actual error</h3><p data-path-to-node=3D"4">Th=
