"0">3. The NuGet Cache is confused (Highly Likely)</b>
Because you suddenly told a multi-platform app to be a Windows app, Visual =
Studio's cache often panics and tries to build Android code without the And=
roid SDK loaded.</p><ul data-path-to-node=3D"13"><li><p data-path-to-node=
=3D"13,0,0"><b data-path-to-node=3D"13,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">The Fi=
