-to-node=3D"2">When the <code data-path-to-node=3D"2" data-index-in-node=3D=
"9">BindableLayout</code> inflates a new row, it processes bindings in para=
llel.</p><ol start=3D"1" data-path-to-node=3D"3"><li><p data-path-to-node=
=3D"3,0,0"><code data-path-to-node=3D"3,0,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">Selec=
tedItem=3D"{x:Binding Category}"</code> evaluates instantly because it binds =
directly to the local model.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=3D"3,1,0"><co=
de data-path-to-node=3D"3,1,0" data-index-in-node=3D"0">ItemsSource=3D"{Bin=
