/li></ol><p data-path-to-node=3D"4">Because <code data-path-to-node=3D"4" d=
ata-index-in-node=3D"8">ItemsSource</code> loses the race, the <code data-p=
ath-to-node=3D"4" data-index-in-node=3D"40">Picker</code> initializes empty=
, clears the selection, and the UI breaks.</p><h3 data-path-to-node=3D"5">T=
he Definitive Fix: Bypass the Binding Engine</h3><p data-path-to-node=3D"6"=
