e=3D"6" data-index-in-node=3D"64">Picker</code> instantaneously, bypassing =
the visual tree walk entirely. The cleanest way to do this in .NET is to mo=
ve those static lists into a globally accessible static class and use <code=
 data-path-to-node=3D"6" data-index-in-node=3D"243">x:Static</code> in the =
