 will be purely structural (<code data-path-to-node=3D"8,1,0" data-index-in=
-node=3D"51">Grid</code>, <code data-path-to-node=3D"8,1,0" data-index-in-n=
ode=3D"57">StackLayout</code>, <code data-path-to-node=3D"8,1,0" data-index=
-in-node=3D"70">SfComboBox</code>). Colors, margins, padding, and fonts wil=
l be left out, assuming your global <code data-path-to-node=3D"8,1,0" data-=
index-in-node=3D"158">Styles.xaml</code> handles them beautifully.</p></li>=
</ul><h3 data-path-to-node=3D"9">A Quick Note on the MVVM Source Generators=
</h3><p data-path-to-node=3D"10">Since your <code data-path-to-node=3D"10" =
