servableProperty]</code> and <code data-path-to-node=3D"10" data-index-in-n=
ode=3D"273">[RelayCommand]</code> code generators. If you prefer manual pro=
perty implementation via <code data-path-to-node=3D"10" data-index-in-node=
=3D"354">BindableProperty</code> or <code data-path-to-node=3D"10" data-ind=
ex-in-node=3D"374">OnPropertyChanged</code> inside the ViewModels, just let=
 me know your preference!</p><hr data-path-to-node=3D"11"><p data-path-to-n=
